#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup instructions to use the REST API to submit IBM Quantum Compute Service jobs"
msgstr "REST API를 사용하여 IBM Quantum Compute Service 작업을 제출하기 위한 설정 안내"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up to use IBM Quantum Platform with REST API"
msgstr "REST API로 IBM Quantum Platform 사용 설정하기"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
